# Build output
/target

# IDE
/.idea
/.vscode/*.log
*.swp

# Test map samples. See examples/lost-temple/README.md for provenance.
#
# Map binaries are not committed, for three independent reasons:
#   - Blizzard's own maps belong to Blizzard and cannot be redistributed;
#   - the sample maps bundled with other projects sit inside GPL-3.0
#     repositories, and copying them here would affect this project's licence;
#   - community maps need the author's permission individually.
#
# To get a sample, place your own, or run
# `cargo run --example make_synthetic -p war3-archive` to generate a structurally
# valid archive.
*.w3x
*.w3m
*.w3n
*.w3g
!examples/**/README.md

# Scratch output
synthetic.w3x
*.tmp
